 "description": "Who says you must choose? The all-new Aquila 46 Coupe power catamaran delivers both sport boat thrills and yacht comforts.\nStep aboard and discover the perfect fusion of style and performance. Its versatile design transitions effortlessly from open-air paradise to fully enclosed retreat, so you can enjoy every moment on the water your way.\nWide decks and appointed interiors create extraordinary living spaces. The beautifully designed primary and guest cabins, each with en-suite bathroom and shower, turn weekend excursions into unforgettable getaways. Social spaces like the cockpit bar window and sheltered bow lounge make hosting sunset gatherings as effortless as escaping for a private retreat.\nAvailable with powerful outboard engines or efficient inboard propulsion, and featuring double stepped hulls with the innovative carbon fiber Aquila Hydro Glide® Foil System, the 46 Coupe delivers a smooth ride with class-leading efficiency.\nBecause out there, possibility beckons.",
